<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Corfivalle Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Corfivalle Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's largest finance company in terms of assets, Corporacion Financiera del Valle SA (Corfivalle), reported the following third quarter results:</p>
<p>Net loss 1.614 billion pesos vs profit 4.993 billion pesos</p>
<p>Net revenues 9.710 billion pesos vs 13.951 billion pesos</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit figure was not available.</p>
<p>Figures are unconsolidated and subject to approval by Colombia's Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>-- Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom +571 6107544</p>
</text>
